      "created_at": "2015-03-14T00:12:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Though he's right that it's where I began</p><p>and where I came up with my plan</p><p>but the full reason why</p><p>I decided to try</p><p>is simply because, well, I can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>and meter is less important than rhyme</p><p>as long as you hit close to right chime</p><p>and it's quite hard enough</p><p>to talk and say stuff</p><p>even given allowance in time</p>",
